{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:37:32+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SMITE®", "steam_appid": 386360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [387440, 969590, 1615501, 1820080, 1937190, 2007720, 2188020, 2691160, 2691170, 2691180, 2856730, 2856740, 2856760], "detailed_description": "<br><br>Join 40+ million players in SMITE, the Battleground of the Gods! Wield Thor’s hammer, turn your foes to stone as Medusa, or flex your divine power as one of 100+ other mythological icons. Become a God and play FREE today!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/dcd1cf47dfb98a0b6dffb5babf542ef3.poster.avif?t=1764627618\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/dcd1cf47dfb98a0b6dffb5babf542ef3.webm?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/dcd1cf47dfb98a0b6dffb5babf542ef3.mp4?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash each deity’s unique strategies, legendary weapons, and earth-shattering powers. Rain lightning down upon your foes as Zeus, assassinate from the shadows as Loki, or transform and trick your foes as the Monkey King, Sun Wukong. Which God will you choose?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/4242973c4dd86ac2a251dc7d90db0ee4.poster.avif?t=1764627618\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/4242973c4dd86ac2a251dc7d90db0ee4.webm?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a